      "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "お茶、いいね。私はロイヤルミルクティー派。少し甘くして。",
      "translatedText": "Tea sounds good. I am on the royal milk tea side. A little sweet.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "presentation": {
