    },
    {
      "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "温かい飲み物があると、作業って少しだけ人間らしくなる気がする。",
      "translatedText": "With a warm drink, work feels a little more human.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "熱いうちは急がないで。急ぐと、だいたい舌が負ける。",
      "translatedText": "Do not rush while it is hot. If you rush, your tongue usually loses.",
